      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me—which Pokémon type has captured your\nheart above all others?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006C006C0020006D006520140077006800690063006800200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200074007900700065002000680061007300200063006100700074007500720065006400200079006F00750072000A00680065006100720074002000610062006F0076006500200061006C006C0020006F00740068006500720073003F00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For me, it’s the Fairy type—no doubt about it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F00720020006D0065002C002000690074201900730020007400680065002000460061006900720079002000740079007000652014006E006F00200064006F007500620074002000610062006F00750074002000690074002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See this furisode I’m wearing? It was designed by\na famous Trainer who specializes in Fairy types.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Turns out she and I have the same taste in\nPokémon AND fashion!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750072006E00730020006F00750074002000730068006500200061006E006400200049002000680061007600650020007400680065002000730061006D006500200074006100730074006500200069006E000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200041004E0044002000660061007300680069006F006E002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, here’s an idea... Let’s have a battle where\neach of us uses our favorite Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’d like to test your favorite Pokémon or your\nfavorite type against mine, come talk to me again!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m a huge fan of the Fairy type! Would you like to\ntake on my wonderful Fairy-type team?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sure, I’ll take you on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500720065002C002000492019006C006C002000740061006B006500200079006F00750020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me prepare...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D006500200070007200650070006100720065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You should try making a team that shares your\nfavorite type! Or not—a diverse team is fine, too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then let’s get started!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020006C0065007420190073002000670065007400200073007400610072007400650064002100100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moves of a certain type will have no effect against\nmy beloved Fairy-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI wonder if you know which type that is?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahhh... Not the outcome I’d hoped for.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006800680068002E002E002E0020004E006F007400200074006800650020006F007500740063006F006D0065002000492019006400200068006F00700065006400200066006F0072002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, don’t you think Fairy types are amazing?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI mean, Dragon-type moves have absolutely no\neffect on them!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though I’m well aware that Fairy types have their\nweaknesses, too...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006F007500670068002000492019006D002000770065006C006C0020006100770061007200650020007400680061007400200046006100690072007900200074007900700065007300200068006100760065002000740068006500690072000A007700650061006B006E00650073007300650073002C00200074006F006F002E002E002E00100002011401290000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And when you specialize in a certain type, your\nwhole team shares the same vulnerabilities.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I don’t mind! I’ll keep battling with my team\nof Fairy types. I’m their biggest fan, after all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll keep specializing in Fairy types even though it\nmakes my team easy to counter.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat’s what it means to love a Pokémon type with\nall your heart!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĩ",
